<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,597.28 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,597.28 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a record high of 6,597.28 points, up 108.65, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 6.352 billion forints, up from 3.306 billion forints on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
